00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.650
And without a doubt,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.252
he was a powerful political

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:53.753
operator and businessman

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:55.755
who sparked more than one scandal.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.892
